Hands-On Activity 3 | Explore CopyAI

Explored the CopyAI website's use cases, resources, and weekly demos. Described CopyAI as an AI-native GTM platform, identified six product categories (Prospecting Cockpit, Content Creation, Inbound Lead Processing, Account Based Marketing, Translation & Localization, Deal Coaching & Forecasting), and outlined pricing tiers (Free, Pro, Enterprise) with their respective features. Includes a supplementary "AI for Oceans" activity from Code.org covering machine learning basics, training data and bias, and the societal impact of AI, culminating in an Hour of Code certificate.
